# PROJECT T.R.A.C.E.

## (Transparency • Resilience • Accountability • Community Verification • Economic Growth)

### Complete Software Development Master Prompt

---

# Overview

Develop a **modern full-stack Barangay Management System** called **Project T.R.A.C.E.** using the following technologies:

### Frontend

* HTML5
* CSS3
* JavaScript (Vanilla)
* Bootstrap 5
* Bootstrap Icons
* Glassmorphism UI
* Responsive Design
* AJAX (without page reload)

### Backend

* PHP 8 (Procedural or MVC-lite)
* MySQL
* XAMPP

### Database

* MySQL

### Development Environment

* XAMPP

### Coding Style

* Simple file structure
* Clean code
* Modular PHP
* Reusable components
* Secure coding practices
* Prepared Statements
* Password Hashing
* Session Authentication
* Role-Based Access Control (RBAC)

---

# General Objectives

The overall aim of this study is to develop **Project T.R.A.C.E. (Transparency, Resilience, Accountability, Community Verification, and Economic Growth)**, an integrated web-based management system for Barangay Tumalaytay.

The system aims to digitize barangay administrative operations, public service requests, document generation, financial monitoring, project management, community engagement, and resident profiling through QR-based identification and a centralized administrative dashboard.

The project seeks to:

* Digitize barangay records
* Improve transparency
* Reduce paperwork
* Improve service delivery
* Improve document processing
* Centralize resident information
* Digitize project monitoring
* Enhance disaster preparedness
* Improve accountability
* Enable community verification using QR technology
* Provide real-time reports
* Improve communication between barangay officials and residents
* Create a secure, paperless information system

